## Presentation captures are committed on purpose — they are the content of
## presentation/index.html, which is useless without them. capture.sh + optimize.py
## regenerate them from the simulator; optimize.py keeps them ~150 KB each.
presentation/shots/*.png
presentation/shots/_*
